Package: extremarank
Type: Package
Title: Exact Sample Deletion Robustness for Omics Rankings
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("ExtremaRank", "Contributors", email = "207506224+heise3@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Audits omics candidate rankings after shared sample or donor
    deletion using native R and C++ computations. Arbitrary precision dyadic
    moments support exact paired extrema, individual membership and effect
    sign certificates, conservative Welch bounds, and minimum deletion change
    intervals. R model refits and donor-level single-cell pseudobulk retain
    their distinct observed sensitivity scope. No Python runtime is used.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp, Matrix, digest
LinkingTo: Rcpp, BH (>= 1.75.0)
Suggests: SummarizedExperiment, SingleCellExperiment, limma, edgeR, DESeq2
SystemRequirements: C++17
URL: https://github.com/heise3/ExtremaRank
BugReports: https://github.com/heise3/ExtremaRank/issues
